# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Secrets — NEVER COMMIT
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.dev
.env.prod
.env.production
.env.staging
!.env.example
!.env.staging.example
!.env.encrypted

# Claude Code runtime — session lock (sessionId, pid). NEVER commit.
.claude/*.lock

# Spike M3 (Story 1.2) — thread_id transient file for crash/resume tests
.spike-thread-id
backend/.spike-thread-id

# Bench M4 (Story 1.3) — artefacts mesure (CSV, ground truth cache regenerable)
_bench_artifacts/
backend/_bench_artifacts/

# SOPS + age — private keys only (public keys *.pub / recipients are safe to commit)
age.key
*.age.key
private.key
deploy.key
*_rsa
*_ed25519
*_ecdsa
*_dsa
!*.pub

# TLS / x509 — private side only (public certs can be committed intentionally
# but by default we ignore *.pem to avoid accidental commits ; override case-by-case)
*.pem
!**/Caddyfile*

